n=14 Phi6=183; construction phase cloud (at t*): [14, 28, 42, 56, 70, 84, 98, 112, 126, 140, 154, 168, 169]
  = AP(step n=14) [14, 28, 42, 56, 70, 84, 98, 112, 126, 140, 154, 168] + KILLER at 182 = -n mod Phi6 = 169
(1) three-gap sizes of the cloud: [1, 14, 28] (three-gap theorem: <=3 distinct); gap multiset sum=183=Phi6
(2) observer(0) clearance = 14/183 = M_C = 0.07650; FLANKING cloud points [14, 169] = {+n, -n} = runners {1, killer} (the Chebyshev 2-point dual, S73)
(3) rotational tournament of the cloud: scores [6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 7, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 5]; #3-cycles c3=90; H (Redei) odd by theorem (13 vertices, not brute-forced)
